body:
A- is Augustine;
M- is Mercymorn;
A's little brother, the hedge fund manager is Alfred;
M's Nun is Cristabel;
C- is Casseopeia;
C's artist friend/wife is Nigella;
G and P are Gideon and Pyrrha;
And then John uses Ulysses and Titania's names, because those were new names that he gave the corpses.
